<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported five ships loading, 15 waiting and 10 due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Monday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load on the West Coast was eight days.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 5	    13</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   0	     2</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
